    "description": "Arc Mainnet is live, and the genesis mint of the $ARC native network token is complete. 60% of supply is allocated to ecosystem airdrops 🪂",
    "logo": "https://i0.wp.com/airdropalert.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Arc-Network-LOGO-1.jpg?resize=50%2C50&#038;quality=50&#038;ssl=1",
    "source": "AirdropAlert",
